            "text": "surface crochet"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to work a small ring of slip stitches, pulling slightly inward to create the sunken effect. Grey yarn gives the best contrast on a white or cream body."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
